aligned}{\\int }_{C}-\\frac{1}{z}\\,dx+x\\,dy+dz & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }-\\frac{1}{z}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,dt+x\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,dt+\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}t}\\,dt \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }(-\\frac{1}{z}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}+x\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}+\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}t})dt \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}\\cdot (-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\cdot 1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }1+2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(t+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =\\pi +2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\pi -0 \\\\  & =\\pi \\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535198 true] [17592186337071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337072 13194139535198 true] [17592186337071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337073 13194139535198 true] [17592186337071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337074 13194139535198 true] [17592186337071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337075 13194139535198 true] [17592186337071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337076 13194139535198 true] [17592186337071 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535198 true] [17592186337071 1041 "selection" 13194139535198 true] [17592186337071 1104 #edb/ref 17592186337074 13194139535198 true] [17592186337071 1110 #uuid "cd9ea258-9454-55c0-a355-a1fc0a48e1ce" 13194139535198 true] [17592186337072 1034 "2-\\pi " 13194139535198 true] [17592186337072 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535198 true] [17592186337072 1111 #uuid "d3f1d29e-e4f4-5e47-994d-e772d5e70597" 13194139535198 true] [17592186337073 1034 "2+\\frac{\\pi }{4}" 13194139535198 true] [17592186337073 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535198 true] [17592186337073 1111 #uuid "fa2a3b17-8aa1-5f6f-acb3-b3120a8ded72" 13194139535198 true] [17592186337074 1034 "\\pi " 13194139535198 true] [17592186337074 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535198 true] [17592186337074 1111 #uuid "8f92d9ca-8eb8-5421-8772-ea7fe7d6651a" 13194139535198 true] [17592186337075 1034 "\\pi +2" 13194139535198 true] [1759218